  titleText: Basic Controls
  actions:
  - ActionType: 1
    MovementSteps: []
    MessageSteps:
    - MessageText: Hello stranger!  You are a squirell and this is your playground...
      DisplayTime: 3
    - MessageText: To survive you have collect nuts and get them to your nests!  
        If  you get nuts to all your homes, you win!
      DisplayTime: 3
    - MessageText: But you will not enjoy your deserved dinner to enjoy your deserved 
        victory. Instead, you will  be teleported to new wooden prison and start 
        over! Well, life is not fair!
      DisplayTime: 3
    - MessageText: But first, let me explain how to control this tiny nutty beast!       
        Mostly you will use arrows. You can use your keyboard or click buttons on 
        the  screen. Lets try to press button up!
      DisplayTime: 3
    UndoCount: 0
    ImageAction:
      Image: {fileID: 0}
      ActionType: 0
      ImageRotation: 0
      DisplayTime: 0
